ack across conditions (FlashAttention-2 or SDPA).</item>\\n<item>A6. Calibration on WikiText-2 train only, never reused for evaluation.</item>\\n<item>A7. This design is the deliverable; the bubblewrap is not expected to execute the experiment.</item>\\n<item>A8. Hypothesized H1-H4 directions/magnitudes are guesses from prior published characterizations, not measurements under this task.</item>\"], \"uncertainties\": [\"U1. KV-cache quantization: include +KV4 cell or keep out of scope (auth question).</item>\\n<item>U2. Strict definition of \\\"end-to-end 4-bit\\\" given paper's small set of outlier channels in higher precision.</item>\\n<item>U3. Primary decoding metric: TPOT vs aggregate tokens/s.</item>\\n<item>U4. 70B in scope given single-GPU assumption.</item>\\n<item>U5. Environment gap: bubblewrap cannot host the measured run; design presumes a separate GPU-equipped environment.</item>\\n<item>U6. LM-Eval-Harness subset identity/size, or perplexity-only as guardrail.</item>\\n<item>U7. Whether to keep the W4A16 intermediate cell as an attributing reference.</item>\"]}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-e77bb6aa-1ecf-45bf-9d3e-037ef2f59031", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 20}
